  data: {
    LLM: "Save your high cards (Aces, Kings) to win control of the lead in the mid-game, then lead your 7s in the final tricks when everyone else has run out of higher cards of that suit.\n\nSuit tracking: Pay close attention to which suits have been 'voided' by other players. If you know the person to your left is out of Diamonds, your Diamond-7 becomes a guaranteed point if you have the lead for the last trick.\n\nDefensive Lead: If you don't have a 7, lead your highest card for the final trick to prevent an opponent from winning with their 7.",
